 Integrating Grafana with Alertmanager
Learning Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Install and configure Prometheus Alertmanager on a Linux system
Set up Grafana to work with Alertmanager for advanced alert handling
Create and configure alerting rules in Prometheus
Configure notification channels in Alertmanager
Test the complete alert flow from Prometheus through Alertmanager to notification endpoints
Understand the relationship between Prometheus, Alertmanager, and Grafana in a monitoring stack
Prerequisites
Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Linux command line operations
Familiarity with YAML configuration files
Basic knowledge of Prometheus and Grafana concepts
Understanding of monitoring and alerting fundamentals
Experience with text editors like nano or vim
