Troubleshooting Tips
Common Issues and Solutions
Issue 1: Services not starting

# Check service logs
sudo journalctl -u prometheus -f
sudo journalctl -u alertmanager -f
sudo journalctl -u grafana-server -f
Issue 2: Alerts not firing

# Verify Prometheus configuration
/usr/local/bin/promtool check config /etc/prometheus/prometheus.yml
/usr/local/bin/promtool check rules /etc/prometheus/alert_rules.yml
Issue 3: Alertmanager not receiving alerts

# Check Prometheus targets
curl http://localhost:9090/api/v1/targets
Issue 4: Grafana not connecting to data sources

# Test data source connectivity
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY" \
  http://localhost:3000/api/datasources/proxy/1/api/v1/query?query=up
Issue 5: Webhook not receiving notifications

# Check Alertmanager configuration
/usr/local/bin/amtool config show --config.file=/etc/alertmanager/alertmanager.yml
Verification Commands
